{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098910/extras/metta.gif?t=1748662473\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are Issei Ito, a talented but underappreciated security specialist at METTA East, drowning in gambling debt and office politics. When a mysterious offer from the company's enigmatic CSO promises to solve all your problems, you're thrust into a dangerous world of corporate conspiracy and moral ambiguity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a diverging plot over two weeks in 1992 Japan, where your choices in dialogue and your actions in the world dramatically impact the course of the story.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whatever your actions, Issei's fate is in your hands.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Work</strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098910/extras/2025-01-10_13-38-22_1.gif?t=1748662473\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Congratulations on the new gig, employee. Every day, you'll be expected to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in daily office tasks through unique minigames</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Balance your performance to maintain an excellent standing.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Hack</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098910/extras/demonstration.gif?t=1748662473\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But your job doesn't stop there. After work, you'll be expected to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Infiltrate secure servers in a strategic, node-based hacking minigame</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deploy virtual 'towers' with various offensive and defensive capabilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Risk detection with each move \u2013 failure could cost you your job</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">That's if you want that debt paid off...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Upgrade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Continually sharpen your hacking ability by unlocking new towers and resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098910/extras/hackingMenu.gif?t=1748662473\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Live</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you're done with all your work, perhaps you could relax by:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spending your evenings exploring the vibrant city of Osaka</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Building relationships with co-workers through various activities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playing minigames with NPCs in bars, arcades, and other locations</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unravel stories of betrayal, revenge, and unexpected alliances.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3098910?t=1748662473","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098910/7ff3e29faa78e6bb236939c167f2f208cd8b7e94/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748662473","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098910/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748662473","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098910/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748662473","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098910/extras/metta.gif?t=1748662473\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are Issei Ito, a talented but underappreciated security specialist at METTA East, drowning in gambling debt and office politics. When a mysterious offer from the company's enigmatic CSO promises to solve all your problems, you're thrust into a dangerous world of corporate conspiracy and moral ambiguity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a diverging plot over two weeks in 1992 Japan, where your choices in dialogue and your actions in the world dramatically impact the course of the story.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whatever your actions, Issei's fate is in your hands.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Work</strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098910/extras/2025-01-10_13-38-22_1.gif?t=1748662473\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Congratulations on the new gig, employee. Every day, you'll be expected to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in daily office tasks through unique minigames</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Balance your performance to maintain an excellent standing.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Hack</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3098910/extras/demonstration.gif?t=1748662473\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But your job doesn't stop there. After work, you'll be expected to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Infiltrate secure servers in a strategic, node-based hacking minigame</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deploy virtual 'towers' with various offensive and defensive capabilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Risk detection with each move \u2013 failure could cost you your job</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">That's if you want that debt paid off...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Upgrade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Continually sharpen your hacking ability by unlocking new towers and resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i